# ================================================================ buying a home

== bold: buying a home / W
base: take a safe fixed-rate mortgage, and never miss a payment
likelier_if: has [good credit] +10; has [bookkeeping] +5
- W | take the shortest mortgage the bank allows, and pay double every month | v: security, conformity | act: take the shortest mortgage the bank will give and pay double every month | chance: 40 | grants: reliable record | takes_if_fails: homeowner
works: {N} makes every double payment on the day, year after year, and the bank and the street both know {N} as someone who pays.
works: Not one payment is late or short, and from then on {Ns} word is counted as good as a signature.
fails: One hard winter the double payments cannot be met, the arrears mount, and the house is sold.
fails: The short loan asks more than the household can find, the bank calls it in, and the house goes.

